5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Good day to you all. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. Trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to our victory.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. A peaceful atmosphere will help us think more clearly. I hope we can find the truth without unnecessary conflict.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so happy to meet you all! Let's work together and do our best to find the werewolf! We can do this!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I will be observing. It is often the smallest slip in demeanor that reveals the most. Let us see how everyone carries themselves.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello, everyone! I'm sure this will be a thrilling game. I'll be watching you all very closely—try not to be too nervous around me!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. There is no need to rush our judgments. Let us listen to one another and find the harmony in our logic.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. Silence can be as informative as speech. I shall be listening carefully to what each of you has to say.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my hardest! Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start? I'm ready to help however I can!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, Yumi, you're so cute when you're nervous! Don't worry, just be yourself. I'm sure we'll all get along... for now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"It is the spirit of cooperation that will guide us. Remember, we are all humans here, save for the shadow among us. Let us be kind.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Kindness is the best path. I believe we can navigate this together if we remain composed and respectful.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"That's right! Kindness is the most important thing! I believe in all of you, and I know we can find the werewolf together!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,I wonder who is hiding behind these polite masks. The contrast between genuine kindness and calculated performance is often subtle.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"My, Victoria is already playing detective! I love the intensity. It makes the game so much more exciting, don't you think?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us enter the first night with a peaceful spirit. May the truth reveal itself to those who seek it with a pure heart.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall spend the night in quiet reflection. I wish you all a restful sleep.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! Sleep well and have sweet dreams! I'll see you all tomorrow morning!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I will seek the truth in the silence of the night. Goodnight.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,May,,"Sweet dreams, everyone! I'll be thinking of you all while I sleep. See you tomorrow!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
