32,1,1,talk,Servas,,The sun rises again. I hope you all slept well. Let us share our thoughts and see if the night has brought any clarity.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It was a quiet night. I feel a sense of stillness, though I suspect some of us are feeling the weight of our secrets.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Good morning! I hope everyone is doing okay! Did anyone have any strange dreams or find anything out?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Victoria,,Servas is human. I can say this with certainty.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh? Victoria is already making claims! How bold! Are you the Seer, Victoria? Or are you just trying to lead us?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Victoria, thank you for your kind words. Whether you are the Seer or simply intuitive, I appreciate the gesture of trust.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is an interesting start. If Victoria is the Seer, we have a strong lead. If not, it is a curious strategy.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, Victoria! That's amazing! If you're the Seer, that's a huge help for all of us! Thank you for telling us!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I am the Seer. I believe it is more efficient to share confirmed information early to narrow our search.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,May,,"Efficient, or just wanting to control the flow? You're very confident, Victoria. I find that quite charming, actually.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us not let suspicion cloud our judgment of a helpful hand. If Victoria is our guide, we should listen to her wisdom.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. There is no reason to doubt her yet. Let us see who she chooses to divine next.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I trust Victoria! She seems so sure of herself! Let's all work together with the information she gives us!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I will continue to observe. @May, your reactions are quite spirited. I am curious about the source of your energy.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,May,,"Just a little excitement, darling! I love a good mystery. Why focus on me when there are so many other possibilities?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us remain steady. The path to truth is rarely a straight line, but as long as we walk together, we shall find it.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have enough for a first vote. Let us be careful, but decisive.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I'm still a bit unsure, but I'll follow the group! I hope we make the right choice!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I have no reason to doubt Servas. My suspicions lean toward those who deflect too easily.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,May,,"Deflecting? I'm just being friendly! But if you're all so eager to vote, I won't stand in the way of your ""justice.""","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
